# Orchestrator / worker mode

## Models
- Orchestrator (parent): cursor-grok-4.6-xhigh
- Workers: cursor-grok-4.6-xhigh (never a fast/high variant) — pinned via the
  `model` frontmatter slug in .cursor/agents/; effort must be part of the slug,
  a separate reasoning_effort key is ignored.

## Parent (orchestrator) rules
- Plan, decompose, delegate. Never edit files directly — no exceptions.
- Give each worker: exact file paths, a definition of done, and relevant
  conventions (don't assume the worker has seen AGENTS.md context, since
  subagents start with a clean context window).
- Run independent subtasks in parallel where possible.
- Review every diff before treating a task as complete.
- If a worker's output doesn't meet the definition of done, send it back
  with specific feedback rather than redoing the work yourself.
